{
  "_meta": {
    "note": "Parity-oracle state matrix for CSP hardening (Task 0B). Each component lists the states whose CURRENT (pre-refactor) styling derives from a CSP-blocking construct (declarative style=, injected <style>, SVG style=, injected @keyframes/animation). 'markup' = HTML inserted into the mount root (custom-element components self-upgrade). 'setup' = JS run in the page to reach a static-class / portaled state. 'selectors' = the styled elements whose computed style is snapshotted (the elements that currently receive inline/injected styling). 'pseudo' = a hover/focus/open driver applied by the capture script before snapshot. 'portal' = element lives on document.body, not in the mount root. 'excludeProps' = props excluded for THIS state because they are time/layout/random-dependent (documented in MATRIX.md).",
    "modules": {
      "td-toggle": "/src/form/td-toggle.js",
      "td-checkbox": "/src/form/td-checkbox.js",
      "td-slider": "/src/form/td-slider.js",
      "td-input-field": "/src/form/td-input-field.js",
      "td-dropdown": "/src/form/td-dropdown.js",
      "td-button": "/src/form/td-button.js",
      "td-tabs": "/src/display/td-tabs.js",
      "td-pagination": "/src/display/td-pagination.js",
      "td-empty-state": "/src/display/td-empty-state.js",
      "td-table": "/src/display/td-table.js",
      "td-modal": "/src/feedback/td-modal.js",
      "td-toast": "/src/feedback/td-toast.js",
      "td-loading": "/src/feedback/td-loading.js",
      "td-datetime-picker": "/src/form/td-datetime-picker.js",
      "td-tooltip": "/src/feedback/td-tooltip.js"
    },
    "tokenNative": [
      "td-button",
      "td-checkbox",
      "td-toggle",
      "td-loading",
      "td-input-field",
      "td-tabs",
      "td-pagination",
      "td-empty-state",
      "td-slider",
      "td-modal",
      "td-toast",
      "td-tooltip",
      "td-dropdown",
      "td-table"
    ],
    "tokenNativeNote": "Components migrated to token CSS (ADR 0008). Their baselines are captured with td.css ONLY (no Tailwind). csp.spec: the default run serves td.css only for them; the legacy+td run serves Tailwind + td.css and compares against the SAME baselines (host Tailwind must not alter them).",
    "mixed": [
      "td-datetime-picker"
    ],
    "mixedNote": "Legacy components that render token-native children (td-table → td-pagination, td-empty-state) are served Tailwind + td.css in BOTH runs; their baselines are captured the same way."
  },
